Honor no-wrap and overflow alignment independently of custom-shape
resize-to-fit. Preserve stored geometry and legacy ODF overflow behavior.

Keep explicit DrawingML anchorCtr centering. Test modern and legacy
layout, rotation and PPTX round-trips with complete presentation fixtures.

AI assistance was used for implementation and regression-test preparation.

NOTE FOR REVIEWERS - original patch and result patch are not identical.
